# .env and .env.local hold local secrets and must never reach an image.
# .env.staging and .env.production are deliberately NOT excluded: they carry the
# per-environment URLs the build needs, they are in git, and they contain no
# secrets — only addresses the browser is sent to, which ship in the bundle
# anyway.
